">徐鶯鶯<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post.html\" target=\"_blank\">母親節、舞親節</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>1</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">林子瑋<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_8.html\" target=\"_blank\">有幾个三工？</a><br />2</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">郭伊貞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/pnge.html\" target=\"_blank\">Pn̄g伊ê福氣</a><br /></span>3</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\">黃子佳<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_55.html\" target=\"_blank\">曝衫</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>4</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/inge.html\" target=\"_blank\">Íng過ê辛勞</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>5</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">Sio招來看戲</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\">黃靜惠<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/e_13.html\" target=\"_blank\">走揣懷念ê食堂氣味</a><br />6</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\">林美麗<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_13.html\" target=\"_blank\">無上班了後</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>12</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\">陳榮廷<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_41.html\" target=\"_blank\">心肝頭若定著</a><br />14</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\">巫素宜<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/mm-bat.html\" target=\"_blank\">老人m̄講古，少年m̄ bat寶</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>16</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\">田美瑜<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_18.html\" target=\"_blank\">偷走厝</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>18</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">棲地復育台語講座</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">主講／何宗勳</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">記錄／吳玉祥</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/e-kap.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>動物伴ê新世代</span>——<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">社區營造kap動物保護</span></a><br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">20</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\">林淑美<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/e_88.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿母ê飯湯</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>22</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\">陳錦月<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2023/06/blog-post.html\" target=\"_blank\">夢著阿母</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>24</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">張日東</span><br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal; white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/e_40.html\" target=\"_blank\">冬瓜山ê舊厝&nbsp;</a></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span>26</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">地名研究室</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\">黃偉嘉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/blog-post_14.html\" target=\"_blank\">西門</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>30</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">主講／吳易叡</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">記錄／王璽馮</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/06/e_14.html\" target=\"_blank\">洗腦ê萬花鏡</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>32</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: 